  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hamkorbank Supporting Sustainable and Inclusive Access to Finance Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The loans entail the Asian Development Bank (ADB) providing medium-term financing to HKB and IYB targeting micro, small, and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs). Proceeds of each loan will be allocated to MSMEs, with (i) at least 60% (IYB) and 80% (HKB) of these MSMEs located outside the capital, Tashkent; (ii) at least 20% of these MSMEs owned or led by women (WMSMEs); and (iii) at least 10% onlent for green technology investments, a nascent but growing segment for Uzbekistan banks.</narrative>
  </description>
